     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left( {18 \\div 3} \\right)\\left( {x + 7 - 4} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Simplify. Divide in the first parentheses.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left( 6 \\right)\\left( {x + 7 - 4} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Subtract in the second parentheses.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left( 6 \\right)\\left( {x + 3} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Use the distributive property.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"6x + 6\\left( 3 \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"6x + 18\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
